<BaseLayout title="About Better Pila" description="Learn who Better Pila serves and how this independent transparency project works.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="narrow"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></div><p class="eyebrow">The project</p><h1>Public information should be easier to use.</h1></div></header>
  <article class="section narrow content paper">
    <h2>What Better Pila is</h2>
    <p>Better Pila is an independent civic project that organizes publicly available information about Pila, Laguna. It aims to make records easier to find, understand, verify, and revisit.</p>
    <h2>What it is not</h2>
    <p>Better Pila is not an official website of the Municipality of Pila and does not speak for any municipal office, official, political party, candidate, contractor, or agency.</p>
    <h2>How to use it</h2>
    <p>Use Better Pila as a starting point. Each substantive record should link to its original sources and show when maintainers last checked it. For authoritative legal or operational decisions, consult the responsible government office and original document.</p>
    <h2>Who maintains it</h2>
    <p>The named maintainer and project contact will be published before launch. The project is being prepared by volunteers with a local connection to Pila.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

